map-delays.conf - one stimulus feeding three Map propagators with delays of
1, 2 and 3 time-steps. The peak of each phi must lag the stimulus pulse by
exactly that many steps. Before the fix the 3-step delay gave zero lag, because it
equalled the history length left by the 2-step propagator, so it wrapped
round. (A lone 1-step delay failed the same way.)

